.TH "GF-ORGS-CREATE-ORG" "1" "Jun 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-orgs-create-org - Creates organization


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf orgs create-org [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates organization

.PP
Only works if users.allow_org_create
\[la]https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/configuration/#allow_org_create\[ra] is set.

.PP
Body schema (CreateOrgCommand):
  name  string

.PP
Response schema (CreateOrgOK.Payload):
  message  string  REQUIRED
                   Message Message of the created org.
  orgId    number  REQUIRED
                   ID Identifier of the created org.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--body\fP=""
	Request body JSON or path to a JSON file (e.g. --body=/path/to/body.json, --body='{"foo": "bar"}'). The 'Body schema' block below lists fields and types; use --describe-body-jsonschema for a strict JSON Schema. [required]

.PP
\fB--describe-body-jsonschema\fP[=false]
	Print the JSON Schema of the request body and exit without calling the API

.PP
\fB--describe-response-jsonschema\fP[=false]
	Print the JSON Schema of the response payload and exit without calling the API

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for create-org

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
